#. <CLT 4>食堂に入ると、
#. まず最初に彼女の姿が目に入った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As I entered the dining hall, the first thing I saw\n"
"was...her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 何を…ジロジロ見てるの…？
msgctxt "0002 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "What are you s-staring at...?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、腐川さん…？
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, Toko...?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あたしを見てると目が腐るって…？
msgctxt "0004 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"What, you think y-your eyes will rot just by l-looking\n"
"at me?"
msgstr ""

#. だったら見なきゃいいじゃない…ッ！！
msgctxt "0005 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Fine, then DON'T l-look at me!"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木っちは、オメーが朝食会に参加してる事に、
#. 驚いてるだけだって…
msgctxt "0006 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I think he's just surprised to see you at the\n"
"breakfast meeting, is all..."
msgstr ""

#. 実際、腐川が朝食会に参加するのは、
#. 久しぶりのはずだ。
msgctxt "0007 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Indeed. It's been quite a while since you joined us."
msgstr ""

#. …どういう心境の変化？
msgctxt "0008 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Yeah, what made you change your mind?"
msgstr ""

#. 白夜様は…ぽっちゃり体型が好みだって…
#. だ、だから…
msgctxt "0009 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Byakuya said he...l-likes a girl to have some meat\n"
"o-on her bones, so..."
msgstr ""

#. 食べるの！　強制的に胃に流し込むの！
#. 倒れるまで食べるわよッ！
msgctxt "0010 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I'm g-gonna start eating! I'm gonna force it d-down\n"
"into my stomach! I'm gonna eat till I d-drop!"
msgstr ""

#. 負けないよッ！！
msgctxt "0011 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I refuse to l-lose!"
msgstr ""

#. やめておけ…
msgctxt "0012 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "I wouldn't do that if I were you..."
msgstr ""

#. それはそうとさ…
#. 霧切さんがいないみたいだけど…
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Well, other than that...it looks like Kyoko isn't\n"
"here."
msgstr ""

#. 後で来る…って言ってたべ。
msgctxt "0014 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Oh, she said she'd come by later."
msgstr ""

#. 後で…？
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Later...?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木っちが帰った後だって…
msgctxt "0016 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Yeah. After you leave."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこまで露骨に嫌われたのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She's not even trying to hide it anymore...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ああいうタイプは強引さに弱いとは言ったけどさ、
#. そういう強引さとは違うんだからね！
msgctxt "0018 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I know I said she wanted you to show some backbone,\n"
"but you didn't need to show her THAT much!"
msgstr ""

#. 不潔だ、苗木は不潔だよッ！　
#. 不潔大臣だよッ！！
msgctxt "0019 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"You're dirty, Makoto! Dirty! President Dirty of\n"
"Dirtlandia!"
msgstr ""

#. ご、誤解だって…！
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You don't understand...!"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木は恋の階段とかすっ飛ばしちゃうタイプなんだね…
#. そうなんでしょ！
msgctxt "0021 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"You're the type who takes the stairs of love three\n"
"steps at a time, aren't you!?"
msgstr ""

#. だ、だから違うって…！
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I'm telling you, it's not like that!"
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと、朝日奈…
#. いい加減にしなさいよ…！
msgctxt "0023 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "J-Just shut up already, Hina...!"
msgstr ""

#. 朝っぱらから…
#. いやらしい話ばっかりして…！
msgctxt "0024 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"You've been running your f-filthy mouth like that all\n"
"m-morning..."
msgstr ""

#. い、いやらしい？　私が？
msgctxt "0025 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Filthy? ME!?"
msgstr ""

#. いやらしいから…
#. いやらしいって言ったのよ…
msgctxt "0026 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Don't m-make me repeat m-myself..."
msgstr ""

#. わ、私は…いやらしくなんかないよッ！
msgctxt "0027 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I'm not filthy!"
msgstr ""

#. 否定したって駄目よ…あんたはいやらしい女なの…
#. あたしには…わかるのよ…
msgctxt "0028 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"It's n-no use denying it. We can all s-see how\n"
"disgusting you are..."
msgstr ""

#. や、やめてよ…
msgctxt "0029 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Sh-Shut up...!"
msgstr ""

#. あんたは…そのワガママなボディーで…
msgctxt "0030 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "You and that lusty body of yours..."
msgstr ""

#. 夜な夜な、禁断のクラブ活動に
#. 精を出してるんでしょ？
msgctxt "0031 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Night after n-night, you go out for your illicit\n"
"c-club meetings..."
msgstr ""

#. ちょ、ちょっと…
#. 下ネタとか…本気でムリなんだって…
msgctxt "0032 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"H-Hey, knock it off. I can't deal with dirty stuff\n"
"like that..."
msgstr ""

#. 深夜の課外授業で…
#. 危険な学級崩壊を重ねてるんでしょ…？
msgctxt "0033 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Your m-midnight sextracurricular activities only put\n"
"us in e-even more danger...!"
msgstr ""

#. や…やめて…って…
msgctxt "0034 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "S-Stop it..."
msgstr ""

#. やめてと言いつつ…
#. あんたの汗ばんだ手は太いチョークを握るのよ！
msgctxt "0035 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"You'd like me to s-stop, wouldn't you? Your sweaty\n"
"h-hands gripping the big, fat chalk t-tight..."
msgstr ""

#. 追試につぐ追試に…
#. あんたの吐息は黒光りする黒板を軋ませ…ッ！
msgctxt "0036 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Going for all that e-extra credit... Your screams are\n"
"like the s-screech of a violated blackboard!"
msgstr ""

#. そして…そしてーッ！！
msgctxt "0037 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "And...! And!"
msgstr ""

#. あぁ！　何これ、すごいわ！
#. ひわいな発想が次々に浮かんでくるッ！！
msgctxt "0038 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Ah! It's a-amazing! Indecent ideas are c-coming to me\n"
"one after another!"
msgstr ""

#. 貴様の顔は、右半分と左半分の
#. どちらを吹き飛ばしても平気なのだ？
msgctxt "0039 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"So, would you rather have your black eye on the left\n"
"or the right?"
msgstr ""

#. ひ、ひぃぃ…ッ！
#. ごめんなさいごめんなさいごめんなさい…ッ！
msgctxt "0040 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Hyeeeh! S-Sorry sorry sorry!"
msgstr ""

#. 欲求不満でおかしくなった腐川っちの事は
#. 置いといてだな…
msgctxt "0041 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Let's leave Toko alone. She's gone a little...funny\n"
"from all her pent-up frustration."
msgstr ""

#. とにかく、苗木っちと霧切っちは、
#. ちゃんと仲直りしといた方がいいべ？
msgctxt "0042 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Anyway, you and Kyoko need to make up already, ya\n"
"know?"
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…わかってるよ…
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-Yeah, I know..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もちろん、すぐにでもそうしたいところだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean, of course I want things to get better as soon\n"
"as possible.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも…すべてのきっかけは、
#. 彼女に<CLT><CLT 3>例の件<CLT><CLT 4>を話せなかった事なんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But with everything that's been going on, I haven't\n"
"had a chance to talk to her about <CLT><CLT 3>what I saw<CLT><CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だから…まずは大神さんに、
#. <CLT><CLT 3>例の件<CLT><CLT 4>を確認しない事にはな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Before anything, I need to <CLT><CLT 3>talk to Sakura<CLT><CLT 4> about it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. うぅ…頭がクラクラするよ…
msgctxt "0047 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Urg... I feel all dizzy..."
msgstr ""

#. 下ネタとか…ホントに無理なんだって…
msgctxt "0048 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I seriously can't handle dirty stuff like that..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんって、
#. 意外な弱点があったんだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like Hina had an unexpected weakness...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ごめんなさいごめんなさいごめんなさいごめんなさい…
#. ぶたないでぶたないでぶたないでぶたないで…
msgctxt "0050 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Sorry sorry sorry sorry! Don't hit me don't hit me\n"
"don't hit me don't hit me!"
msgstr ""

#. ぶつなら白夜様にして白夜様ならぶってください…
#. お願いですぶってください白夜様ぶってください…
msgctxt "0051 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"If you w-wanna hit someone, hit Master. Please h-hit\n"
"him. Oh, please *please* let me w-watch you hit him!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やっぱ…この人には
#. 深入りしない方がよさそうだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I think it's best if I stay far, *far* away from\n"
"her...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. まぁ、元気出せって！
#. 女に嫌われるぐらい大した事じゃねーべ！
msgctxt "0053 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Cheer up, man! It's not a big deal if a girl doesn't\n"
"like ya!"
msgstr ""

#. 俺みたいに…
#. 女から訴えられるよりマシだべ…
msgctxt "0054 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"It's better than having one sue ya!\n"
"...Like I did."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クン…ずいぶんな修羅場を経験してるんだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Jeez, Hiro. You've lived a pretty brutal life...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あのさ…大神さん…
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "U-Um...Sakura?"
msgstr ""

#. …どうした？
msgctxt "0057 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr ""

#. …後で、ちょっと時間ないかな？
#. 話がしたいんだけど…
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Can you make some time later? I was hoping I could\n"
"talk to you."
msgstr ""

#. あ！　苗木がさくらちゃんを口説こうとしてるッ！
#. 霧切ちゃんにフラれたからって！
msgctxt "0059 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Ah! Now that Kyoko's dumped him, Makoto's trying to\n"
"win Sakura's heart!"
msgstr ""

#. メスなら誰でもいいのね、苗木は発情期なのね？
#. し、仕方がないわね…高校生ですものね…
msgctxt "0060 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Are you in h-heat, Makoto? Don't care who they a-are\n"
"as long as they've g-got the right equipment?"
msgstr ""

#. さくらちゃん、気を付けて！
#. 苗木は野獣になったんだよ！　野獣大臣なんだよッ！
msgctxt "0061 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Watch out, Sakura! Makoto's transformed into a wild\n"
"beast! Prime Minister Wild Beast of Beastopia!"
msgstr ""

#. どうして…そうなるんだって…
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Why is this happening to me...?"
msgstr ""

#. …苗木よ、話は明日にしてもらえぬか？
#. 今日は部屋で休ませて欲しいのだ。
msgctxt "0063 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Can our talk wait till tomorrow? I'd like to get some\n"
"rest today..."
msgstr ""

#. ここ数日…どうも体の具合が優れぬのでな…
msgctxt "0064 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"For some reason, I've been feeling worn down these\n"
"last few days."
msgstr ""

#. え、どっか悪いの？
msgctxt "0065 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Huh? Are you sick? Did you get hurt?"
msgstr ""

#. 大した事ではない…
#. 少々、体の節々を痛めただけだ…
msgctxt "0066 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"No, nothing serious. I've just had some minor aches\n"
"and pains."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>え？　それって、もしかして…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Huh? Is that...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの時のバトルのせい…だよな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It must be because of that battle...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0069 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. でも…さくらちゃんが休むなんてよっぽどじゃない？
#. 本当に大丈夫なの？
msgctxt "0070 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"But it must be pretty bad if you have to go rest. Are\n"
"you sure you're okay?"
msgstr ""

#. プロテインを飲んで寝ていれば、
#. すぐに治るはずだ。
msgctxt "0071 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I'm sure a protein shake and some sleep will get me\n"
"back on my feet."
msgstr ""

#. プロテインは万病に効くもんね。
msgctxt "0072 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "That's true, protein is good for all kinds of stuff!"
msgstr ""

#. プロテインは、お前らん中で、
#. どんだけ神格化されてんだべ…
msgctxt "0073 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"You guys, like, worship protein. It's like your god or\n"
"something..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木！　なんの話か知らないけど明日にしてあげて！
#. さくらちゃんは体が痛いんだからね！
msgctxt "0074 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Makoto! I dunno what it is you wanna talk to Sakura\n"
"about, but save it till tomorrow! She's in pain!"
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…わかったよ…
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-Yeah, I got it..."
msgstr ""

#. すまんな…
msgctxt "0076 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr ""

#. そんじゃ…とりあえずメシにすんべ！
msgctxt "0077 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Well...for now, let's eat!"
msgstr ""

#. ご、ご飯…？　緊張するわ…
msgctxt "0078 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "E-Eat? I'm kinda n-nervous..."
msgstr ""

#. なんで緊張？
msgctxt "0079 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Huh? How come?"
msgstr ""

#. し、仕方ないじゃない…
#. 人前で…食事するのに慣れてないんだから…
msgctxt "0080 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Cuz...I don't usually...e-eat in front of other\n"
"p-people."
msgstr ""

#. こ、子供の時から…
#. ずっと１人で…食事してたから…
msgctxt "0081 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Ever since I w-was a kid, I'd...eat b-by myself."
msgstr ""

#. 家族は…？
msgctxt "0082 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "What about your family?"
msgstr ""

#. …いるわよ。父と母と母で暮らしてる。
msgctxt "0083 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Oh, well y-yeah. I used to live with my d-dad, my mom,\n"
"and my m-mom."
msgstr ""

#. 母が２人？
msgctxt "0084 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "You had...two moms?"
msgstr ""

#. 家庭事情よ…
msgctxt "0085 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "What? That's just how th-things were..."
msgstr ""

#. 深刻だべ！
msgctxt "0086 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "That's, like, a serious issue!"
msgstr ""

#. …放っておきなって。
#. 腐川と絡むとロクな事がないよ…
msgctxt "0087 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Just let it go. You're asking for trouble getting\n"
"involved with her more than you have to."
msgstr ""

#. いやらしいお口でよく言うわね…
msgctxt "0088 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"How d-dare you speak to me with that d-disgusting\n"
"mouth of yours..."
msgstr ""

#. や、やめてって…ッ！！
msgctxt "0089 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "S-Stop saying stuff like that!"
msgstr ""

#. えっと…とにかくボクは先に食べちゃうね。
msgctxt "0090 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "A-Anyway...I'm gonna go ahead and eat."
msgstr ""

#. ボクが食べないと…
#. 霧切さんも来られないんだもんね…
msgctxt "0091 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "If I don't, Kyoko will never show up."
msgstr ""

#. せつないべ…
msgctxt "0092 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Pretty miserable situation, man."
msgstr ""

#. は、はは…
msgctxt "0093 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "H-Hehe..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクはかき込むように朝食を平らげると、
#. 一足先に自室へと戻った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0094 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I scarfed down breakfast as fast as I could and\n"
"immediately headed back to my room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここで出て行っても仕方ない…
#. 大神さんに話をしてみよう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0095 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no point in leaving now. I need to talk to\n"
"Sakura...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここで出て行っても仕方ない…
#. 大神さんに話をしてみよう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0096 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no point in leaving now. I need to talk to\n"
"Sakura...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
